1
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:11,625
Target Zoe

2
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:13,250
confirmed dead.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,500
I asked Ching He's chairman for a favor.

4
00:00:19,541 --> 00:00:21,625
This is a life-saving charm.

5
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:23,541
CHING HE TEMPLE

6
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:26,208
If you find yourself in danger,
use this to call Ching He.

7
00:00:27,083 --> 00:00:30,041
There is evidence inside
that'll keep the Hsueh family in check.

8
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:11,583
Hello?

9
00:01:11,666 --> 00:01:12,833
Hello?

10
00:01:16,166 --> 00:01:18,000
Gerald Chen told me

11
00:01:19,041 --> 00:01:21,083
that if my life was in danger,

12
00:01:21,166 --> 00:01:22,958
I should make this call.

13
00:01:23,541 --> 00:01:24,750
If you're there,

14
00:01:25,291 --> 00:01:27,166
save me and my daughter.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,958
I understand.

16
00:01:30,583 --> 00:01:32,500
I'll send someone right away.

17
00:01:48,875 --> 00:01:50,791
THE FIXERS

18
00:02:08,458 --> 00:02:10,291
FAKE, FORSAKEN, FRAUD

19
00:02:13,958 --> 00:02:17,875
The fact Zoe's alive
isn't just bad for Yeh Yueh Tong.

20
00:02:18,375 --> 00:02:19,708
It's also a threat

21
00:02:20,208 --> 00:02:21,333
to the Hsueh clan.

22
00:02:21,416 --> 00:02:23,541
-I won't hurt her.
-I know you won't do that.

23
00:02:26,166 --> 00:02:27,833
At least not at the moment.

24
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:29,916
Meaning?

25
00:02:31,291 --> 00:02:35,166
I can't predict
what you could do just to score points.

26
00:02:35,666 --> 00:02:36,875
From the very beginning,

27
00:02:38,416 --> 00:02:40,416
I was used by you to find her.

28
00:02:41,083 --> 00:02:42,250
Isn't that right?

29
00:02:49,958 --> 00:02:54,041
I've disobeyed my father
all my life. He can't stand me either.

30
00:02:55,583 --> 00:02:56,625
You're right though.

31
00:02:56,708 --> 00:03:00,375
If I was to bring Zoe home,
he'd think better of me.

32
00:03:00,458 --> 00:03:01,708
You're right there.

33
00:03:04,041 --> 00:03:06,166
-What are you gonna do?
-You first.

34
00:03:09,583 --> 00:03:11,875
Fan sent a guy to kill Gerald.

35
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:15,125
She won't get away with it.

36
00:03:15,625 --> 00:03:18,333
You're declaring war
on the whole of Yeh Yueh Tong?

37
00:03:19,041 --> 00:03:21,041
Surely you've considered
how hard that's going to be?

38
00:03:21,125 --> 00:03:22,708
How can I not do it?

39
00:03:23,791 --> 00:03:25,458
Gerald is gone.

40
00:03:25,541 --> 00:03:27,833
You don't have to follow him to the grave.

41
00:03:28,833 --> 00:03:30,250
Don't lecture me.

42
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:36,000
-It's my life.
-You dying won't bring him back.

43
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:40,041
-You hear me?
-You ever had someone you care about?

44
00:03:49,375 --> 00:03:51,916
BROTHER: DAD ISN'T WELL.
COME TO THE HOSPITAL QUICKLY.

45
00:03:55,083 --> 00:03:56,458
What's going on with Dad?

46
00:03:57,083 --> 00:04:00,500
The doctor says liver cancer.
It's metastasized.

47
00:04:01,125 --> 00:04:03,000
Why didn't I hear about this earlier?

48
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:06,708
He told me not to tell you.
He didn't want you to worry.

49
00:04:07,416 --> 00:04:10,708
He's not doing well today.
Don't rile him up, okay?

50
00:04:14,458 --> 00:04:16,291
Dad. How are you doing?

51
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,958
All right.

52
00:04:19,458 --> 00:04:21,500
I just had chemo.

53
00:04:22,041 --> 00:04:23,291
I feel a bit off.

54
00:04:25,416 --> 00:04:27,125
About my illness…

55
00:04:27,666 --> 00:04:29,833
It must be kept quiet.

56
00:04:30,875 --> 00:04:35,208
At a time like this, your health
is more important than politics.

57
00:04:35,291 --> 00:04:36,625
Why didn't you tell me?

58
00:04:37,208 --> 00:04:39,750
What about you?

59
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:43,083
When did you join Ching He?

60
00:04:45,125 --> 00:04:47,333
Did you ever consider

61
00:04:47,416 --> 00:04:48,958
that Thackery

62
00:04:49,625 --> 00:04:52,916
let you join Ching He for a reason?

63
00:04:54,083 --> 00:04:55,666
You working for him,

64
00:04:56,333 --> 00:05:01,583
any time, anywhere,
he could use you as a pawn to threaten us.

65
00:05:01,666 --> 00:05:03,541
You need to trust me.

66
00:05:04,541 --> 00:05:07,625
If anything does happen,
I won't drag in the family.

67
00:05:10,333 --> 00:05:13,875
Do you honestly think
I only worry about your brother?

68
00:05:15,083 --> 00:05:16,875
You're also my son.

69
00:05:25,666 --> 00:05:27,541
I often wonder…

70
00:05:30,458 --> 00:05:32,750
did I show you enough care?

71
00:05:34,291 --> 00:05:37,666
All my resources went into your brother.

72
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:40,791
That's why,

73
00:05:41,291 --> 00:05:43,291
you did this as a challenge.

74
00:05:45,375 --> 00:05:47,125
I was too hard on you,

75
00:05:49,041 --> 00:05:50,750
when I think about it now.

76
00:05:53,666 --> 00:05:56,500
I never gave you the opportunity to shine.

77
00:05:58,125 --> 00:05:59,625
So all of this,

78
00:06:00,541 --> 00:06:04,708
it was because you were afraid my real
identity might embarrass the family?

79
00:06:06,125 --> 00:06:07,958
If I cared about all that,

80
00:06:08,041 --> 00:06:10,500
why would I have kept you by my side?

81
00:06:14,708 --> 00:06:16,750
I failed your mother.

82
00:06:18,833 --> 00:06:20,250
Before she died,

83
00:06:21,375 --> 00:06:22,666
I vowed to her

84
00:06:23,708 --> 00:06:27,666
that I would do my best to raise you well.

85
00:06:30,625 --> 00:06:34,166
I just hope that before you do anything,

86
00:06:34,666 --> 00:06:36,125
don't rush into it.

87
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:37,875
Consider

88
00:06:38,541 --> 00:06:40,041
the Hsueh clan.

89
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:43,708
I'm getting old.

90
00:06:45,375 --> 00:06:49,583
The time I have left to watch you both,
it's running out.

91
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Now,

92
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:56,000
you and Tristan,

93
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,625
look after each other.

94
00:06:59,458 --> 00:07:00,375
Please.

95
00:07:12,833 --> 00:07:14,000
Are you okay?

96
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:18,333
So you know
that I joined Ching He to become a fixer.

97
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,208
How'd you find out?

98
00:07:23,791 --> 00:07:25,916
Dad didn't say who told him.

99
00:07:27,333 --> 00:07:29,083
You know William's dead, right?

100
00:07:29,708 --> 00:07:33,083
The news said he suicided.
He gassed himself in his car.

101
00:07:33,166 --> 00:07:34,583
You didn't invest with him, did you?

102
00:07:37,083 --> 00:07:38,916
The Hsin Nan redevelopment zone funds

103
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,125
were laundered through William.
Am I right?

104
00:07:46,333 --> 00:07:47,500
How do you know that?

105
00:07:48,333 --> 00:07:50,041
I have my sources.

106
00:07:53,375 --> 00:07:56,541
The Hsin Nan redevelopment zone
is a huge cash cow.

107
00:07:57,041 --> 00:07:59,000
Everyone in the party took a bribe.

108
00:07:59,791 --> 00:08:04,000
Dad's political clout had eroded.
He needed to please the head honchos.

109
00:08:04,083 --> 00:08:05,375
He had no choice.

110
00:08:05,458 --> 00:08:07,208
He had to get his hands dirty.

111
00:08:09,125 --> 00:08:12,000
Then why get Yeh Yueh Tong
to kill Zoe's family?

112
00:08:13,083 --> 00:08:15,541
Zoe's husband, Hsu Ming-yi,
knew everything.

113
00:08:16,041 --> 00:08:17,166
He tried to bribe Dad.

114
00:08:17,250 --> 00:08:20,708
He even wanted Dad to back him
in his run for office.

115
00:08:27,125 --> 00:08:29,375
Hsu Ming-yi also found out, uh,

116
00:08:29,458 --> 00:08:31,916
about Dad's affair
with a student who then had you.

117
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:34,833
He blackmailed him.

118
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:38,000
Dad wanted to protect you.

119
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:40,208
As well as the Hsueh clan.

120
00:08:40,708 --> 00:08:42,041
He had no other option.

121
00:08:42,541 --> 00:08:45,500
That's when he went
to Yeh Yueh Tong for help.

122
00:08:53,375 --> 00:08:54,666
He's not well now.

123
00:08:55,166 --> 00:08:56,958
It's best just to let it go.

124
00:09:00,083 --> 00:09:02,750
I'm gonna go see him before I go. You?

125
00:09:04,291 --> 00:09:05,500
I'll stay a little.

126
00:09:25,791 --> 00:09:26,625
AUTHENTIC TIEN-BU-LA

127
00:09:26,708 --> 00:09:28,791
A new drug was discovered at the scene.

128
00:09:28,875 --> 00:09:31,166
After ingesting it,
the user may experience

129
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:35,875
vomiting, diarrhea, or even fall into
an unconscious state, mimicking death.

130
00:09:35,958 --> 00:09:37,958
Excuse me. Are you still serving?

131
00:09:38,041 --> 00:09:39,583
Sorry, we're closed.

132
00:09:39,666 --> 00:09:42,666
…investigating the origin
of this mysterious substance.

133
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:48,291
They are unsure of whether the drug itself
had actually been ingested by the victim…

134
00:10:00,958 --> 00:10:02,583
Long time no see.

135
00:10:18,916 --> 00:10:20,708
SHEN: BEN IS IN TROUBLE

136
00:11:13,833 --> 00:11:15,708
GERALD CHEN, YEH YUEH TONG

137
00:11:15,791 --> 00:11:17,875
MISSING, KIDNAPPED, DRUGS

138
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:21,125
At first,

139
00:11:21,666 --> 00:11:23,916
in order to find Gerald,

140
00:11:24,416 --> 00:11:26,166
you joined Yeh Yueh Tong.

141
00:11:27,458 --> 00:11:28,750
I knew

142
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:30,958
as soon as I saw you

143
00:11:31,458 --> 00:11:34,083
he had found an excellent trainee.

144
00:11:35,833 --> 00:11:36,958
Let him go.

145
00:11:39,125 --> 00:11:40,458
Where's Zoe?

146
00:11:47,958 --> 00:11:50,833
If I just pull it out,
you do know what'll happen?

147
00:11:51,958 --> 00:11:56,166
Why send someone to kill Gerald
and still get me to look for him?

148
00:11:57,166 --> 00:11:59,166
We never found his body.

149
00:11:59,791 --> 00:12:04,083
At first, I just wanted to know
if he was alive or dead.

150
00:12:04,166 --> 00:12:06,291
Then I discovered Zoe,

151
00:12:06,791 --> 00:12:10,166
to my horror, still wasn't dead.

152
00:12:10,833 --> 00:12:11,916
Let him go!

153
00:12:12,416 --> 00:12:14,416
And if you can, kill me.

154
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,708
You're just as good as Gerald,

155
00:12:16,791 --> 00:12:18,791
yet somehow,

156
00:12:20,458 --> 00:12:22,291
I have no trust in you.

157
00:12:24,416 --> 00:12:26,083
Where is Zoe?

158
00:12:26,166 --> 00:12:28,583
Don't tell her!

159
00:12:29,333 --> 00:12:33,375
Even if you do tell her,
she… she won't let us go.

160
00:12:33,458 --> 00:12:38,000
I'm sure you know
he can't hold on forever.

161
00:12:41,666 --> 00:12:42,875
I have no idea.

162
00:12:42,958 --> 00:12:47,000
I didn't expect that Zoe's life
would be more important than his.

163
00:12:51,583 --> 00:12:53,250
I have no idea.

164
00:12:53,833 --> 00:12:55,458
Please.

165
00:12:56,208 --> 00:12:57,291
That's enough.

166
00:13:03,583 --> 00:13:05,125
Let him go.

167
00:13:08,291 --> 00:13:09,583
Louis Hsueh.

168
00:13:10,083 --> 00:13:12,041
The Hsueh's second son.

169
00:13:12,541 --> 00:13:14,541
-The pleasure is all mine.
-Let them go.

170
00:13:15,916 --> 00:13:17,458
Let's just drop this.

171
00:13:18,625 --> 00:13:21,833
Are all the Ching He fixers so cocky?

172
00:13:21,916 --> 00:13:26,625
When Dad hears how very badly
Yeh Yueh Tong dealt with this,

173
00:13:27,125 --> 00:13:28,916
how do you think he'll react?

174
00:13:29,791 --> 00:13:33,125
Are you asking that
as a member of which clan?

175
00:13:34,166 --> 00:13:36,708
Ching He or Hsueh?

176
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,916
What do you think?

177
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,416
You must know.

178
00:13:55,041 --> 00:13:57,416
I'm the one
standing with the Hsueh family.

179
00:13:58,458 --> 00:13:59,333
Mina,

180
00:13:59,833 --> 00:14:02,416
his fate is due to your betrayal.

181
00:14:10,583 --> 00:14:11,791
Gerald…

182
00:14:12,416 --> 00:14:14,333
Did they really kill him?

183
00:14:17,833 --> 00:14:19,708
This isn't your fault.

184
00:14:22,708 --> 00:14:25,458
Y… You… You have to keep going.

185
00:14:26,666 --> 00:14:28,916
Live your life.

186
00:14:31,083 --> 00:14:33,208
When I see Gerald,

187
00:14:34,375 --> 00:14:35,250
I…

188
00:14:35,958 --> 00:14:38,208
I'll spell this out to him.

189
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:40,916
Mm-hmm.

190
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,250
The stall downstairs.

191
00:14:45,208 --> 00:14:47,000
Okay.

192
00:14:47,083 --> 00:14:48,375
I know.

193
00:14:54,625 --> 00:14:56,250
Don't leave me!

194
00:15:01,333 --> 00:15:03,791
Please don't leave me!

195
00:15:45,125 --> 00:15:48,666
Shanghai Express.
Are you available to receive a package?

196
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:50,291
It's safe. You can speak.

197
00:15:50,375 --> 00:15:51,666
Why'd you disappear?

198
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:53,250
The chairman's looking for you.

199
00:15:55,375 --> 00:15:56,333
Ben's dead.

200
00:15:58,416 --> 00:15:59,416
Say what?

201
00:16:00,041 --> 00:16:01,083
Ben's dead?

202
00:16:02,541 --> 00:16:05,416
We didn't find Gerald, but we found Zoe.

203
00:16:06,125 --> 00:16:08,458
And I just rescued Mina from Madam Fan.

204
00:16:09,083 --> 00:16:10,500
But I couldn't save Ben.

205
00:16:11,416 --> 00:16:12,958
How did you find Zoe?

206
00:16:13,958 --> 00:16:16,750
Gerald was sent by Yeh Yueh Tong
to kill Zoe.

207
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:19,500
He couldn't do it,
so they faked her death.

208
00:16:20,083 --> 00:16:23,958
Now Madam Fan knows Zoe's alive,
she's going to finish the job.

209
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,083
No wonder the chairman
wants me to protect her.

210
00:16:27,166 --> 00:16:30,041
-I'm on my way to pick her up.
-How did the chairman find out?

211
00:16:30,708 --> 00:16:32,458
He didn't really explain.

212
00:16:32,958 --> 00:16:34,166
I just have to bring her back.

213
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:36,083
Okay. Be careful.

214
00:16:36,166 --> 00:16:38,125
Yeh Yueh Tong won't let go of this one.

215
00:16:38,208 --> 00:16:41,666
Don't worry. If they wanna
take me out, they'll have to get in line.

216
00:16:48,333 --> 00:16:49,166
Felix?

217
00:16:51,083 --> 00:16:53,208
Mm-hmm. He's got Zoe.

218
00:16:53,958 --> 00:16:55,625
He's taking her to Ching He.

219
00:16:57,083 --> 00:16:59,416
How does Ching He know about Zoe?

220
00:17:01,791 --> 00:17:03,125
Why are you asking me?

221
00:17:04,791 --> 00:17:08,416
Get some rest. Then get on a plane tonight
and get out of here.

222
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,208
Who said I was leaving?

223
00:17:10,916 --> 00:17:12,750
You think you'll be spared by Fan?

224
00:17:12,833 --> 00:17:14,916
Ben was the only one I called family!

225
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:17,000
I'll get my revenge.

226
00:17:17,083 --> 00:17:19,250
We don't know
why Ching He's looking for Zoe.

227
00:17:19,833 --> 00:17:22,291
I don't want you
to get caught in the crossfire.

228
00:17:25,458 --> 00:17:26,875
Are you worried about me?

229
00:17:27,375 --> 00:17:29,916
Or the impact on the Hsueh clan?

230
00:17:31,583 --> 00:17:32,875
Think what you like.

231
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:35,583
It's your life.

232
00:17:36,083 --> 00:17:38,958
I just don't wanna collect your body
later, that's all.

233
00:17:43,041 --> 00:17:45,166
I'll take care of this myself.

234
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,166
I won't bother you.

235
00:18:00,208 --> 00:18:03,541
I thought you were an expert
at covering your tracks.

236
00:18:04,333 --> 00:18:06,416
Louis knows we hired Yeh Yueh Tong.

237
00:18:07,458 --> 00:18:10,291
Don't worry. I'll clean this up.

238
00:18:12,833 --> 00:18:15,041
And I won't leave any loose ends.

239
00:18:15,541 --> 00:18:17,541
Everything's in place regarding Thackery.

240
00:18:18,250 --> 00:18:20,416
Let's not make any more errors.

241
00:18:35,833 --> 00:18:37,083
What's wrong?

242
00:18:44,458 --> 00:18:46,083
It's the sod-turning event.

243
00:18:46,583 --> 00:18:48,666
Don't worry. Everything's been done.

244
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:55,625
I don't think, um,

245
00:18:57,041 --> 00:18:58,500
I'm gonna make it

246
00:18:59,166 --> 00:19:01,000
to the day you become mayor.

247
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:05,416
Dad, I got you the best doctor around.

248
00:19:06,333 --> 00:19:08,916
If they can't find a cure,
we'll go abroad.

249
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,375
You can beat this.

250
00:19:11,458 --> 00:19:12,958
I will make certain

251
00:19:13,458 --> 00:19:15,750
that you see me climb to the top.

252
00:19:16,375 --> 00:19:17,791
Not just mayor.

253
00:19:24,041 --> 00:19:27,333
You… …I have never worried about.

254
00:19:29,291 --> 00:19:31,083
Your brother, however,

255
00:19:31,583 --> 00:19:33,291
that's another story.

256
00:19:34,458 --> 00:19:36,875
As long as he's working for Ching He,

257
00:19:37,375 --> 00:19:39,416
I will never rest.

258
00:19:40,083 --> 00:19:43,083
Don't worry. He's a member
of the Hsueh clan.

259
00:19:43,583 --> 00:19:46,208
Does he think of himself that way?

260
00:19:46,708 --> 00:19:48,916
He became a fixer

261
00:19:49,416 --> 00:19:51,250
without consulting me.

262
00:19:51,916 --> 00:19:53,916
If you hadn't intervened,

263
00:19:54,833 --> 00:19:55,916
I would have…

264
00:19:56,416 --> 00:19:58,208
I would have…

265
00:19:58,291 --> 00:19:59,541
Dad.

266
00:19:59,625 --> 00:20:01,625
Don't think about it.

267
00:20:01,708 --> 00:20:03,666
Your health is the most important thing.

268
00:20:04,541 --> 00:20:05,833
You know how Louis is.

269
00:20:05,916 --> 00:20:09,250
You force him to quit now,
he'll only run further away.

270
00:20:10,916 --> 00:20:13,166
I'd suggest you let him
stay with Ching He.

271
00:20:13,791 --> 00:20:15,791
That could even benefit us in time.

272
00:20:18,208 --> 00:20:19,166
Hm.

273
00:20:21,166 --> 00:20:26,083
You… You haven't wasted all the mentoring
I gave you over the years.

274
00:20:26,958 --> 00:20:29,291
I can only thank you for all your help.

275
00:20:32,208 --> 00:20:33,333
Get some rest.

276
00:20:34,875 --> 00:20:36,250
Leave everything to me.

277
00:20:45,416 --> 00:20:46,625
Promise me.

278
00:20:48,333 --> 00:20:50,125
Don't hurt your brother.

279
00:20:54,166 --> 00:20:55,250
We're blood.

280
00:20:56,916 --> 00:20:58,250
How could I do that?

281
00:21:21,458 --> 00:21:24,791
It's been a long time
since you've come to offer incense.

282
00:21:25,958 --> 00:21:27,666
I was last here

283
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:30,500
when my father was in control.

284
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,875
Coming back this time,

285
00:21:33,375 --> 00:21:35,041
I had to prepare myself.

286
00:21:35,125 --> 00:21:36,041
Hm.

287
00:21:36,791 --> 00:21:39,250
This time, what would you
like to pray for?

288
00:21:44,625 --> 00:21:47,291
All that I pray
is that I get what I'm owed.

289
00:21:47,791 --> 00:21:48,791
Hm.

290
00:21:50,166 --> 00:21:51,791
Everything I did

291
00:21:52,291 --> 00:21:54,208
was for the benefit of Ching He.

292
00:21:54,291 --> 00:21:55,958
Is that any different

293
00:21:56,708 --> 00:21:58,541
to me and my father?

294
00:22:01,541 --> 00:22:07,791
Lunar, we often find that,
if we upset the world's equilibrium,

295
00:22:08,541 --> 00:22:11,666
well, then, good intentions can go wrong.

296
00:22:14,333 --> 00:22:16,208
All I know

297
00:22:17,666 --> 00:22:19,958
is that I won't back down again,

298
00:22:20,041 --> 00:22:22,500
because I consider this my home.

299
00:22:27,791 --> 00:22:29,333
Shall I see you out now?

300
00:22:29,416 --> 00:22:31,416
I should be seeing you out.

301
00:22:32,125 --> 00:22:33,916
Well, this is goodbye.

302
00:22:38,916 --> 00:22:41,416
I'm sorry. Mr. Hsueh has to leave
for another appointment.

303
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:46,333
Embezzled funds have ended up
in the current mayor's hands. Comment?

304
00:22:46,416 --> 00:22:49,291
I'm not in a position to speak on it.
It's under investigation.

305
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:53,416
But I do believe that, as a politician,

306
00:22:53,500 --> 00:22:56,041
integrity, that's key.

307
00:22:56,125 --> 00:22:59,333
-Will the party take disciplinary action?
-Please stop here. Thank you.

308
00:22:59,416 --> 00:23:01,416
Do you think the mayor
should make an apology?

309
00:23:01,500 --> 00:23:04,916
What kind of disciplinary
action might the party implement?

310
00:23:05,416 --> 00:23:09,708
Mr. Huang, we're investigating
legislator Chao Ming-cheng's bribery case.

311
00:23:09,791 --> 00:23:13,541
You're suspected of being a mediator.
Come to the station for questioning.

312
00:23:14,458 --> 00:23:18,166
We have a search warrant. We're now
going to search Ching He Temple.

313
00:23:18,875 --> 00:23:20,833
-All right, start the search.
-Yes sir.

314
00:23:40,541 --> 00:23:44,333
There are new developments in
legislator Chao Ming-cheng's bribery case.

315
00:23:44,416 --> 00:23:47,291
Investigators have begun
a second wave of searches.

316
00:23:47,375 --> 00:23:50,833
This time, targeting
the chairman of Ching He, Thackery Huang.

317
00:23:50,916 --> 00:23:54,166
Huang is suspected of being a middleman
in the bribery scheme.

318
00:23:54,250 --> 00:23:56,666
He was taken in
for questioning earlier today.

319
00:23:58,541 --> 00:24:01,875
-Sir, can you comment?
-I wanna talk to you in private.

320
00:24:04,708 --> 00:24:06,833
Was it you who got Thackery arrested?

321
00:24:11,375 --> 00:24:12,375
It was.

322
00:24:13,208 --> 00:24:15,125
Are you helping Fan seize Ching He?

323
00:24:15,625 --> 00:24:19,166
Ching He belonged to Madam Fan.
It's hardly seizing.

324
00:24:19,958 --> 00:24:21,500
You're supporting Madam Fan?

325
00:24:21,583 --> 00:24:24,416
It's more than just Dad's affairs.
Am I right?

326
00:24:28,833 --> 00:24:30,958
I always said you were the smart one.

327
00:24:31,666 --> 00:24:32,958
Dad never believed it.

328
00:24:35,625 --> 00:24:37,000
What's your plan?

329
00:24:37,833 --> 00:24:39,916
Ching He's Primordial Files.

330
00:24:40,708 --> 00:24:41,958
I want them.

331
00:24:43,916 --> 00:24:46,500
-You want those secret files?
-Correct.

332
00:24:47,708 --> 00:24:50,583
The previous Fixer Celestial,
Madame Fan's dad,

333
00:24:51,083 --> 00:24:53,041
he hid the Primordial Files.

334
00:24:53,125 --> 00:24:55,916
They're in a secret room
in the Kuang Ming Chamber.

335
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:58,125
Only Madam Fan knows how to open it.

336
00:24:58,875 --> 00:25:00,666
Not even Thackery knows.

337
00:25:02,250 --> 00:25:05,416
So you want to get
the Primordial Files from Madam Fan.

338
00:25:06,708 --> 00:25:08,791
She knows everything Dad's done.

339
00:25:09,291 --> 00:25:11,041
If she reclaims Ching He,

340
00:25:11,125 --> 00:25:13,208
she'll have absolute control.

341
00:25:13,708 --> 00:25:15,333
We could never fight her off.

342
00:25:15,833 --> 00:25:18,458
The files will give us
the necessary power.

343
00:25:18,958 --> 00:25:21,166
We'd have influence
on both sides of the law.

344
00:25:22,333 --> 00:25:24,916
Then neither Ching He nor Yeh Yueh Tong

345
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
could ever threaten the Hsueh clan.

346
00:25:29,875 --> 00:25:31,541
Is this really necessary?

347
00:25:31,625 --> 00:25:32,958
You don't have to help.

348
00:25:36,583 --> 00:25:38,208
But if we don't succeed,

349
00:25:39,166 --> 00:25:41,500
those you care about could be in danger.

350
00:25:53,083 --> 00:25:55,000
First, we get rid of Thackery.

351
00:25:55,708 --> 00:25:57,000
Then Madam Fan.

352
00:25:57,791 --> 00:25:59,000
And Ching He, well,

353
00:26:00,375 --> 00:26:02,458
I see you as its new leader.

354
00:26:04,083 --> 00:26:05,791
I take charge of Ching He?

355
00:26:07,041 --> 00:26:10,166
Only by standing at the top
and seizing the reins

356
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:13,125
can you possibly
save the ones you care about.

357
00:26:19,625 --> 00:26:21,166
When I run this town,

358
00:26:21,666 --> 00:26:23,541
and you control Ching He,

359
00:26:24,291 --> 00:26:25,791
you'll be in the dark

360
00:26:26,375 --> 00:26:27,791
while I'll be in the light.

361
00:26:28,375 --> 00:26:29,875
Two brothers united.

362
00:26:31,250 --> 00:26:33,458
I mean, who could possibly threaten us?

363
00:26:49,666 --> 00:26:50,708
Howie,

364
00:26:51,291 --> 00:26:54,291
does your dad really have Parkinson's?

365
00:26:55,208 --> 00:26:56,583
Well, that's what he said.

366
00:26:57,166 --> 00:26:58,750
He told me not to tell you.

367
00:27:00,291 --> 00:27:02,250
Your dad speaks
a lot of nonsense sometimes--

368
00:27:02,333 --> 00:27:04,083
He had a bag of pills.

369
00:27:10,750 --> 00:27:12,416
Howie, listen to me.

370
00:27:12,916 --> 00:27:15,000
I'll make sure he's looked after properly.

371
00:27:15,083 --> 00:27:18,041
-You focus on your studies. Everything--
-What are you talking about?

372
00:27:18,125 --> 00:27:20,208
I'll take care of him, too, all right?

373
00:27:20,291 --> 00:27:22,291
Your dad's so stubborn.

374
00:27:22,375 --> 00:27:24,791
The thing with the necklace
would have been fine,

375
00:27:24,875 --> 00:27:26,791
but he had to put on an act
which made me think--

376
00:27:26,875 --> 00:27:27,708
Hey.

377
00:27:28,333 --> 00:27:29,541
Tell him you worked it out.

378
00:27:30,416 --> 00:27:32,875
-Not that I squealed.
-I wouldn't do that.

379
00:27:36,916 --> 00:27:38,833
Look at us. We're like two silly kids.

380
00:27:39,333 --> 00:27:41,958
Oh. Ridiculous.

381
00:27:43,583 --> 00:27:45,583
Oh. Felix forgot his keys.

382
00:27:45,666 --> 00:27:47,000
How many times?

383
00:28:08,958 --> 00:28:10,375
What's going on?

384
00:28:11,708 --> 00:28:13,458
Car must have broken down.

385
00:28:14,750 --> 00:28:17,666
The road's blocked. Wait in the car.

386
00:28:18,166 --> 00:28:21,583
Hello there. I'm here for Felix.

387
00:28:22,291 --> 00:28:23,666
What's this about?

388
00:28:30,916 --> 00:28:32,958
We're business associates.

389
00:28:35,916 --> 00:28:38,041
Associates in what?

390
00:28:39,125 --> 00:28:44,166
How come I haven't heard anything
about a business before this?

391
00:28:46,083 --> 00:28:48,333
-Is he not here?
-No, he's not.

392
00:28:49,458 --> 00:28:53,791
How about you just leave me your phone
number and I'll have him contact you?

393
00:29:17,250 --> 00:29:19,625
And your son? Where is he?

394
00:29:19,708 --> 00:29:20,833
Uh, my son's out.

395
00:29:22,083 --> 00:29:24,416
He's on a study date with his classmates.

396
00:29:38,083 --> 00:29:42,250
You've lived in this house
for over 20 years, right?

397
00:29:44,291 --> 00:29:46,458
We've lived here since we were married.

398
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:48,500
We've never moved.

399
00:29:49,125 --> 00:29:50,333
That's so touching.

400
00:29:51,541 --> 00:29:52,875
You and he…

401
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:54,666
All that love.

402
00:29:58,333 --> 00:30:00,125
But you can't be sure.

403
00:30:00,625 --> 00:30:05,625
I would suggest there are a lot of things
he doesn't share.

404
00:30:08,208 --> 00:30:09,750
I told Felix,

405
00:30:10,250 --> 00:30:12,166
inside this house, I run everything.

406
00:30:12,250 --> 00:30:15,333
When it comes to his affairs outside,
I don't wanna know.

407
00:30:15,416 --> 00:30:16,916
Nor will I get involved.

408
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:18,958
If you're done here,
I'd like you to leave--

409
00:30:19,041 --> 00:30:23,125
I need to discuss
something important with Felix.

410
00:31:44,750 --> 00:31:47,916
Dad, get back here. We're in danger.

411
00:31:49,458 --> 00:31:52,500
HOWIE, TAKE CARE OF YOUR MOM.
TELL HER I'LL BE BACK SOON!

412
00:32:29,875 --> 00:32:31,750
I'm gonna take a look. You stay here.

413
00:32:31,833 --> 00:32:32,708
Okay.

414
00:32:36,125 --> 00:32:38,875
Sorry. I've called roadside assistance.

415
00:32:38,958 --> 00:32:41,500
My son has a fever.
I have to get him to the hospital.

416
00:32:41,583 --> 00:32:44,166
I've been here two hours.
It shouldn't be too much longer.

417
00:33:10,166 --> 00:33:11,708
I'll get you to a hospital.

418
00:33:14,458 --> 00:33:15,583
Please listen.

419
00:33:16,375 --> 00:33:18,500
You must look after her.

420
00:33:25,250 --> 00:33:26,291
CHING HE TEMPLE

421
00:33:26,375 --> 00:33:27,583
Take this.

422
00:33:30,041 --> 00:33:31,541
Give it to Thackery Huang.

423
00:33:33,208 --> 00:33:34,416
The images…

424
00:33:35,666 --> 00:33:37,291
They…

425
00:33:39,625 --> 00:33:41,291
have to do with….

426
00:33:41,375 --> 00:33:42,625
CHING HE TEMPLE

427
00:33:42,708 --> 00:33:44,458
…the Hsueh clan.

428
00:33:47,375 --> 00:33:48,250
Oh.
